          "heading": "Digital Presentation",
          "text": "A digital presentation communicates information through a sequence of slides that can combine text, images, tables, diagrams, charts, audio or video. Effective presentation design gives each slide a clear purpose and arranges information so that an audience can understand the main message without being overwhelmed."
