          "text": "A slide is easier to understand when it has a dominant message. That does not mean every slide must contain only one sentence; it means the audience should know what idea connects the elements on the slide. If a slide contains unrelated facts, the speaker may need to explain the relationships verbally, increasing cognitive load."
